    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d477">

                <pb facs="0451" n="335" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg335"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the American Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 161.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-08-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 21, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I enclose, with office copy, a letter
                    addressed by the President to the King of Denmark, acknowledging His Majesty’s
                    letter of June 21st last, in which he informed the President of the death of
                    King Frederik VIII, and his accession to the throne.</p>
                <p>You will forward the copy to the Foreign Office and deliver the original in the
                    manner most agreeable to His Majesty.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d477-a1.xml" xpointer="d477-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
